window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-007-cc000bf7875f31c1.json"]={sha256:"cc000bf7875f31c1c6ee00ebf8c5032cb3e45a2efe3355077f38ab286d096332",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-f00fcd198c8b61e8","url":"https://docs.archer2.ac.uk/user-guide/hardware/","title":"ARCHER2 hardware","titleEn":"ARCHER2 hardware","publisher":"ARCHER2 service","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-007","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-007","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-008","referenceUrls":["https://www.r-ccs.riken.jp/en/fugaku/about/"],"title":"Fugaku：層級故障域中的碎片分散","titleEn":"Fugaku: shard placement across hierarchical failure domains","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付兄弟核心圖、配置前後對照、跨 socket 去重測例與未映射 CPU 的錯誤報告；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the sibling map, before-and-after assignments, cross-socket deduplication case and an explicit unmapped-CPU error report. State the placement contract independently of any measured speedup. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"每個 shard_id 必須只有一個 board_id 與 rack_id；列舉每塊板被移除後剩餘的碎片，而非只畫機櫃外觀。","differenceEn":"Assign every shard_id exactly one board_id and rack_id, then enumerate survivors after removing each board. Preserve the hierarchy so a later rack-level analysis cannot mistake different boards for independent racks.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["將邏輯 CPU 映射到 socket、core 複合鍵，再計算唯一核心數除以目標核心數；不可跨 socket 單獨以 core_id 去重；十六執行緒名義上使用八個核心的兩個 SMT 兄弟；變更為十六個核心各一執行緒，目標均為十六核心；名義式 8/16*100 = 50 %；變更式 16/16*100 = 100 %。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","最壞單板損失比例為該板碎片數最大值除以全部碎片數；此比例描述暴露面，不代表系統失效機率；十二個等大且互異的碎片，名義每板四片分三板；變更每板兩片分六板；名義式 4/12*100 = 33.3333333333 %；變更式 2/12*100 = 16.6666666667 %。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Map logical CPUs to composite socket-and-core keys, then divide unique physical cores by the target count. Deduplicating bare core_id values across sockets can incorrectly merge different cores. In the teaching topology, sixteen workers initially occupy two siblings on each of eight cores. The changed assignment occupies one thread on each of sixteen cores. The target is sixteen physical cores in both cases. Nominal 8/16*100 = 50 %; changed 16/16*100 = 100 %. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Worst single-board exposure is the largest shard count in one board divided by the total number of shards. It measures placement exposure, not failure probability or recoverability without a separate redundancy contract. Place twelve equal-sized, distinct shards across three teaching boards with four shards per board, then across six boards with two each. This deliberately reduced hierarchy is separate from Fugaku’s published hardware counts. Nominal 4/12*100 = 33.3333333333 %; changed 2/12*100 = 16.6666666667 %. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-017","referenceUrls":["https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/admin-guide/RAS/main.html"],"title":"EDAC：以暴露時間正規化可更正錯誤","titleEn":"EDAC: exposure-normalized corrected-error evidence","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付兄弟核心圖、配置前後對照、跨 socket 去重測例與未映射 CPU 的錯誤報告；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the sibling map, before-and-after assignments, cross-socket deduplication case and an explicit unmapped-CPU error report. State the placement contract independently of any measured speedup. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"每事件列 module_id、timestamp、severity、counter_epoch；每模組另列有效觀測區間，不能以單一牆鐘跨度替代暴露量。","differenceEn":"Record module_id, timestamp, severity and counter_epoch for each event. Keep per-module valid observation intervals separately, rather than using one wall-clock span for modules with missing telemetry.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["將邏輯 CPU 映射到 socket、core 複合鍵，再計算唯一核心數除以目標核心數；不可跨 socket 單獨以 core_id 去重；十六執行緒名義上使用八個核心的兩個 SMT 兄弟；變更為十六個核心各一執行緒，目標均為十六核心；名義式 8/16*100 = 50 %；變更式 16/16*100 = 100 %。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","聚合率為有效觀測期內 CE 總數除以各模組觀測小時總和；排除停機期間並保持事件層級一致；十六個模組連續觀測 24 小時，名義 32 個 CE、變更 64 個；假設無重置且報告已去重；名義式 32/(16*24) = 0.0833333333333 CE/module-hour；變更式 64/(16*24) = 0.166666666667 CE/module-hour。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Map logical CPUs to composite socket-and-core keys, then divide unique physical cores by the target count. Deduplicating bare core_id values across sockets can incorrectly merge different cores. In the teaching topology, sixteen workers initially occupy two siblings on each of eight cores. The changed assignment occupies one thread on each of sixteen cores. The target is sixteen physical cores in both cases. Nominal 8/16*100 = 50 %; changed 16/16*100 = 100 %. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Aggregate rate is corrected-error count divided by summed observed module-hours. Exclude unobserved downtime and keep the event hierarchy consistent, avoiding double-counting controller and module reports. Observe sixteen modules continuously for twenty-four hours. The nominal fixture contains 32 corrected errors and the changed fixture 64, with no counter reset and already deduplicated events. Nominal 32/(16*24) = 0.0833333333333 CE/module-hour; changed 64/(16*24) = 0.166666666667 CE/module-hour. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-a6a67dfa13ea9e55","url":"https://www.r-ccs.riken.jp/en/fugaku/about/","title":"About Fugaku","titleEn":"About Fugaku","publisher":"RIKEN R-CCS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-63024dfa2bd4eed6","url":"https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/admin-guide/RAS/main.html","title":"Reliability, Availability and Serviceability","titleEn":"Reliability, Availability and Serviceability","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
